  [228175]={summary="Formula: Libram of Holy Alacrity (#249530), Enchanting 300; 240 Merchant's Favor; published sellers: Alliance Alynsia, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Beneris, west of Crossroads, The Barrens. Tooltip: Honored with this faction (live stock/gates unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=249530",patternID=249530,recipeReference=true,details="Exact book tooltip: Enchanting 300 to learn; requires Honored with this faction, without naming the faction. Camp guides identify Azeroth Commerce Authority for Alliance and Durotar Supply and Logistics for Horde; this is published context, not an independently confirmed current book-specific faction gate. No gate is inferred from cost or a similar pattern.\nAlliance seller: Alynsia (NPC 256732), Three Corners, western Redridge Mountains. Horde seller: Beneris (NPC 248199), outside the west gate of the Crossroads in The Barrens. Both exact item tables list 240 Merchant's Favor (currency 3402). Stock quantity, current inventory and access remain unverified.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
