  [250561]={summary="Plans: Officer's Sabatons (#251413), Blacksmithing 240; 90 Merchant's Favor; published sellers: Alliance Stondry Darkhammer, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Gor'mak, west of Crossroads, The Barrens. Tooltip: Honored with this faction (live stock/gates unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=251413",patternID=251413,recipeReference=true,details="Exact book tooltip: Blacksmithing 240 to learn; requires Honored with this faction, without naming the faction. Camp guides identify Azeroth Commerce Authority for Alliance and Durotar Supply and Logistics for Horde; this is published context, not an independently confirmed current book-specific faction gate. No gate is inferred from cost or a similar pattern.\nAlliance seller: Stondry Darkhammer (NPC 256730), Three Corners, western Redridge Mountains. Horde seller: Gor'mak (NPC 248197), outside the west gate of the Crossroads in The Barrens. Both exact item tables list 90 Merchant's Favor (currency 3402). Stock quantity, current inventory and access remain unverified.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
