  [250605]={summary="Plans: Steel Spear (#251457), Blacksmithing 160; published book-drop leads: Thousand Needles: Saltstone Crystalhide (NPC 4151) (published; live unverified; non-exhaustive).",confidence="published-forever-book-drop-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=251457",patternID=251457,recipeReference=true,details="Published book-source research. These sources concern the learnable recipe book, not drops of finished crafted gear. No current rate, exclusive source, fastest farm, guaranteed spawn/reward or live acquisition claim. Retrieved tables are not established as exhaustive. Tables can retain historical data.\nThousand Needles: Saltstone Crystalhide (NPC 4151).\nSaltstone Crystalhide published NPC map footprint: Thousand Needles x 69.2–88.6, y 52.2–90.6. These are reference ranges, not a central waypoint/current sighting.\nNo vendor/quest route is established by these exact book tables; absence is not proof none exists. Quest, book-learning and equip gates remain separate; NPC rank is not current loot proof."},
  [250606]={summary="Plans: Iron Morningstar (#251458), Blacksmithing 165; published vendor references: Gorhak — Desolace; Molkar — Desolace (live stock/access unverified). Magram/Gelkis gate interpretation differs by source; see Guide. Also a published Big, No, MASSIVE Iron Axes quest choice lead.",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=251458",patternID=251458,recipeReference=true,details="Published book vendor/source references; current inventory/access unverified.\nGorhak (NPC 253139), Desolace; listed price 15 x Carved Centaur Totem (#254432); stock quantity unverified. Published map footprint: Desolace x 66.2–66.2, y 79.4–79.4. Stock, current access and prices remain live-unverified; map ranges are not a single waypoint or current sighting.\nMolkar (NPC 253140), Desolace; listed price 60 x Carved Centaur Totem (#254432); stock quantity unverified. Published map footprint: Desolace x 35.6–35.6, y 92–92. Stock, current access and prices remain live-unverified; map ranges are not a single waypoint or current sighting.\nExact book tooltip lists: Honored with Magram Clan Centaur; Exalted with Gelkis Clan Centaur. The source does not establish whether these are seller alternatives or cumulative purchase/learning conditions. A Friendly quest reward lead also exists; do not assume it bypasses learning requirements or that both standings must be obtained. Verify the current NPC/book requirements.\nAlternate published quest: Big, No, MASSIVE Iron Axes (#92818), minimum level 30; choice reward: select this exact book. Quest page directs 2 Massive Iron Axes to Grolkar (NPC 253163), Magram Village, Desolace; Friendly Magram objective. Book-table faction differs from quest-page presentation, so faction access remains unresolved. Quest delivery requirements are separate from crafting ingredients. Current access/prerequisites remain unverified."},
