  [280306]={summary="Schematic: Whimsical Waistwrap (#280321): Engineering 175; vendor references: Alliance Fritz Fizzle, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Fizzlefuse, near Crossroads, The Barrens; 180 Merchant's Favor (published listings; live stock/gates unverified). Published requirement: Friendly reputation (Alliance: Azeroth Commerce Authority; Horde: Durotar Supply and Logistics; published faction gates, live access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280321/schematic-whimsical-waistwrap",patternID=280321,recipeReference=true,details="The exact schematic tooltip requires Friendly but does not name its faction. The published Fritz Fizzle inventory specifies Azeroth Commerce Authority. The independently read Fizzlefuse guide explicitly links this exact schematic ID/name to Friendly Durotar Supply and Logistics; this supplements the Alliance guide. Both remain published references, not live purchase verification.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
